00:54:59.000 --> 00:55:13.860
Did you know that there was also an arcade game named Ninja Gaiden made by Tecmo and that neither of the games are ports of each other, but were just parallel projects developed by different teams within Tecmo with no relation to one another?

00:55:42.440 --> 00:55:43.840
Interesting.

